+1. **War Room** — Run a meeting or simulation with AI agents
+2. **Save** — Click "Save to Reports" when you're satisfied with the results
+3. **Action Items** — AI extracts structured action items from the meeting summary
+4. **Execute** — Click "Execute" on items you want to act on → creates a Directive
+5. **Directive Pipeline** — Agents execute in hierarchical order:
+   - **Phase 1** (Staff) → Data collection and research
+   - **Phase 2** (Manager) → Analysis with Staff findings
+   - **Phase 3** (Director) → Verification, challenging prior conclusions
+   - **Phase 4** (C-Suite) → Strategic synthesis and final report
+   - Each phase receives prior results with an **independent verification mandate** — agents must form their own judgment before comparing
+6. **Review** — Review agent reports in the Chairman Dashboard
+
+Items you don't execute remain as records in the report — no noise in your pipeline.
+
