+### 🔌 Connect via MCP (Model Context Protocol)
+Companies can expose an MCP server for real-time agent access:
+
+```yaml
+# company.yml
+subsidiaries:
+  - name: "Acme Corp"
+    mcp_endpoint: "http://localhost:3001/mcp"
 ```
 
-Byzantine Principle in action: analysis (Gemini) → challenge (GPT-4o) → synthesis (Claude). Different companies, different architectures, different blind spots.
+Agents will query the MCP server for live company data instead of static snapshots. The MCP client supports:
+- MCP JSON-RPC protocol (`resources/list`, `resources/read`)
+- Fallback to plain JSON API endpoints
+- Resources: `company://info`, `company://products`, `company://team`
+
+### 🌍 Bilingual Support
+- Toggle between English and Korean (한국어) with the language switcher
+- All UI text supports both languages
