-## Database
+## Tech Stack
 
-_y supports three database backends:
+- **Frontend**: Next.js 16, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS
+- **UI Components**: shadcn/ui, Lucide Icons, ReactFlow
+- **Backend**: Supabase (PostgreSQL), Next.js API Routes
+- **AI Models**: Claude (Anthropic), Gemini (Google), DeepSeek R1, Qwen3, MiniMax M2.5 via Ollama
+- **Deployment**: Vercel
 
-### SQLite (Default)
-Zero configuration. Data stored locally in `data/y-company.db`.
